# loft_ring.tlspr's smooth loft closed into a ring by [closed] on its
# screen, then held square to its third profile by that row's [change]
# given 1; the same as path_loft_ring_held.go makes
# (TestPathEquivalence/loft_ring_held).
file $testdata/ui/loft_ring.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
twmove 137 400
twdown L 137 400
twup L 137 400
twmove 407 330
twdown L 407 330
twup L 407 330
twmove 263 170
twdown L 263 170
twup L 263 170
edit 1
